{"id":"f17aee2187c4f0d4","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-goldbach.md","title":"Goldbach Conjecture","display":"df-goldbach — Goldbach Conjecture","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-goldbach","aliases":["58-df-goldbach"],"display":"df-goldbach — Goldbach Conjecture","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-goldbach"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-goldbach</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-goldbach — Goldbach Conjecture"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3322615e4eea05e9\" href=\"?note=3322615e4eea05e9\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-prime.md\">../batch20/58-df-prime.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,p,q,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(N,p,q,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>（素数谓词，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3322615e4eea05e9\" href=\"?note=3322615e4eea05e9\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-prime.md\">../batch20/58-df-prime.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GoldbachRep}_S(N)\">\\(\\mathrm{GoldbachRep}_S(N)\\)</span> 与闭命题 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Goldbach}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Goldbach}_S\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}goldbach\\text{-}representation} \\vdash \\mathrm{GoldbachRep}_S(N)\\leftrightarrow\\exists p,q\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\land\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(q)\\land N=p+q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}goldbach\\text{-}representation} \\vdash \\mathrm{GoldbachRep}_S(N)\\leftrightarrow\\exists p,q\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\land\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(q)\\land N=p+q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}goldbach} \\vdash \\mathrm{Goldbach}_S\\leftrightarrow\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(2&lt;N\\land\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(N=2k)\\to\\mathrm{GoldbachRep}_S(N)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}goldbach} \\vdash \\mathrm{Goldbach}_S\\leftrightarrow\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(2&lt;N\\land\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(N=2k)\\to\\mathrm{GoldbachRep}_S(N)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Vinogradov (1937): weak Goldbach for large <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> by circle method.</li>\n<li>Hardy–Littlewood: circle method predicts asymptotic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(N) \\sim \\frac{N}{\\log^2 N} \\prod_{p|N} (1 + \\frac{1}{p-2})\">\\(R(N) \\sim \\frac{N}{\\log^2 N} \\prod_{p|N} (1 + \\frac{1}{p-2})\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Strong Goldbach remains open; it is logically distinct from the twin-prime conjecture.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-prime.md","status":"resolved","id":"3322615e4eea05e9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-prime.md","status":"resolved","id":"3322615e4eea05e9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}$（素数谓词，see [[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"N,p,q,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GoldbachRep}_S(N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Goldbach}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}goldbach\\text{-}representation} \\vdash \\mathrm{GoldbachRep}_S(N)\\leftrightarrow\\exists p,q\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\land\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(q)\\land N=p+q)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}goldbach} \\vdash \\mathrm{Goldbach}_S\\leftrightarrow\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(2<N\\land\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(N=2k)\\to\\mathrm{GoldbachRep}_S(N)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"R(N) \\sim \\frac{N}{\\log^2 N} \\prod_{p|N} (1 + \\frac{1}{p-2})","display":false}],"bytes":1183,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-354","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-goldbach]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-592","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-goldbach.md|58-df-goldbach]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["3322615e4eea05e9"]}